Subject: [PATCH] Remove standalone Subjects page; add curriculum auto-fill for
 Subject Assignments

- Delete the standalone Subjects master-list page (views/urls/templates).
  New subjects can now be created inline from the Assign Subject form.
- Add students/curriculum_data.py with Bangladesh curriculum defaults for
  Primary, Junior Secondary, SSC (group-wise) and HSC (group-wise) classes.
- Add students/curriculum_apply.py, a shared idempotent helper used by both
  the seed_subject_requirements management command and the new
  'Auto-fill from Curriculum' button on the Subject Assignments page.
- SubjectRequirementForm now supports creating a brand-new Subject inline
  (code/name/full marks/category) instead of requiring the old master list.
- Sidebar: remove the standalone 'Subjects' and 'Subject Assignments' nav
  links; Subject Assignments is now reached as a contextual tab from the
  Students and Admission pages instead.
